UPDATE c SET brand=CASE WHEN DATALENGTH(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(v.brand,NCHAR(9),N''''),NCHAR(10),N''''),NCHAR(11),N''''),NCHAR(12),N''''),NCHAR(13),N''''),NCHAR(32),N''''),NCHAR(160),N''''),NCHAR(5760),N''''),NCHAR(8192),N''''),NCHAR(8193),N''''),NCHAR(8194),N''''),NCHAR(8195),N''''),NCHAR(8196),N''''),NCHAR(8197),N''''),NCHAR(8198),N''''),NCHAR(8199),N''''),NCHAR(8200),N''''),NCHAR(8201),N''''),NCHAR(8202),N''''),NCHAR(8232),N''''),NCHAR(8233),N''''),NCHAR(8239),N''''),NCHAR(8287),N''''),NCHAR(12288),N''''),NCHAR(65279),N''''))=0 THEN NULL ELSE v.brand END,product_type=CASE WHEN DATALENGTH(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(v.product_type,NCHAR(9),N''''),NCHAR(10),N''''),NCHAR(11),N''''),NCHAR(12),N''''),NCHAR(13),N''''),NCHAR(32),N''''),NCHAR(160),N''''),NCHAR(5760),N''''),NCHAR(8192),N''''),NCHAR(8193),N''''),NCHAR(8194),N''''),NCHAR(8195),N''''),NCHAR(8196),N''''),NCHAR(8197),N''''),NCHAR(8198),N''''),NCHAR(8199),N''''),NCHAR(8200),N''''),NCHAR(8201),N''''),NCHAR(8202),N''''),NCHAR(8232),N''''),NCHAR(8233),N''''),NCHAR(8239),N''''),NCHAR(8287),N''''),NCHAR(12288),N''''),NCHAR(65279),N''''))=0 THEN NULL ELSE v.product_type END,source_name=CASE WHEN DATALENGTH(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(REPLACE(v.source_name,NCHAR(9),N''''),NCHAR(10),N''''),NCHAR(11),N''''),NCHAR(12),N''''),NCHAR(13),N''''),NCHAR(32),N''''),NCHAR(160),N''''),NCHAR(5760),N''''),NCHAR(8192),N''''),NCHAR(8193),N''''),NCHAR(8194),N''''),NCHAR(8195),N''''),NCHAR(8196),N''''),NCHAR(8197),N''''),NCHAR(8198),N''''),NCHAR(8199),N''''),NCHAR(8200),N''''),NCHAR(8201),N''''),NCHAR(8202),N''''),NCHAR(8232),N''''),NCHAR(8233),N''''),NCHAR(8239),N''''),NCHAR(8287),N''''),NCHAR(12288),N''''),NCHAR(65279),N''''))=0 THEN NULL ELSE v.source_name END
 FROM #CatalogClassification c JOIN #StockPage s ON s.id=c.id JOIN erp_migration.accepted_price_products b ON b.product_id=s.id JOIN erp_migration.records r ON r.run_id=N''VEGA-OPENING-TEST-20261004-06'' AND r.entity=N''products'' AND r.source_key=b.product_source_key
 CROSS APPLY OPENJSON(r.payload_json) WITH(brand nvarchar(250) ''$.brand'',product_type nvarchar(250) ''$.category'',source_name nvarchar(500) ''$.name'') v;
IF EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM #StockPage s JOIN erp_migration.accepted_price_products b ON b.product_id=s.id JOIN dbo.products p ON p.id=s.id JOIN erp_migration.records r ON r.run_id=N''VEGA-OPENING-TEST-20261004-06'' AND r.entity=N''products'' AND r.source_key=b.product_source_key CROSS APPLY OPENJSON(r.payload_json) WITH(brand nvarchar(250) ''$.brand'',product_type nvarchar(250) ''$.category'') v WHERE EXISTS(SELECT CONVERT(varbinary(max),p.brand),CONVERT(varbinary(max),p.category) EXCEPT SELECT CONVERT(varbinary(max),v.brand),CONVERT(varbinary(max),v.product_type))) THROW 51102,''WORK_CATALOG_BINDING_DRIFT'',1;
UPDATE c SET display_code=LEFT(p.stock_code,CASE WHEN DATALENGTH(p.stock_code)>DATALENGTH(c.brand)+2 THEN(DATALENGTH(p.stock_code)-DATALENGTH(c.brand)-2)/2 ELSE 0 END) FROM #CatalogClassification c JOIN #StockPage s ON s.id=c.id JOIN dbo.products p ON p.id=c.id WHERE c.verified=1 AND c.brand IS NOT NULL AND DATALENGTH(p.stock_code)>DATALENGTH(c.brand)+2 AND CONVERT(varbinary(max),RIGHT(p.stock_code,DATALENGTH(c.brand)/2+1))=CONVERT(varbinary(max),N'' ''+c.brand) AND UNICODE(RIGHT(LEFT(p.stock_code,CASE WHEN DATALENGTH(p.stock_code)>DATALENGTH(c.brand)+2 THEN(DATALENGTH(p.stock_code)-DATALENGTH(c.brand)-2)/2 ELSE 0 END),1)) NOT IN(9,10,11,12,13,32,160,5760,8192,8193,8194,8195,8196,8197,8198,8199,8200,8201,8202,8232,8233,8239,8287,12288,65279);
